 games.\n\n---\n\n### 🐜 Build An Ant Empire\n- **Smart Kaitun** — Fully automated food farming, selling, ant rolling, and progression.\n- **Auto Food Farm** — Collect worker ant food, carry resources, and sell with minimum-price control.\n- **Ant Automation** — Auto roll, rarity-based claiming, and equip best ants.\n- **Smart Upgrades** — Automatically upgrade pools and stats with cash reserves and custom priorities.\n- **Auto Rewards & Travel** — Claim online rewards, travel between destinations, and return to saved positions.\n- **Player Utilities** — Walk Speed, Fly, Noclip, Fullbright, and ESP.\n- **Extra** — Stop All, MarioBanner, English/Thai UI, and saved configurations.\n\n### 💣 +1 TNT Mining\n- **Smart Auto Mine** — Target valuable mining spots and automatically collect drops.\n- **Remote Collect & Sell** — Collect and sell resources from anywhere.\n- **Fast Auto Click** — Maximum game-supported clicking speed.\n- **Auto Progression** — Rebirth, best bomb, upgrades, new areas, and mine luck.\n- **Pet Automation** — Auto hatch, equip best, and sell extras with rarity protection.\n- **Extra** — Secret Block Alerts, Auto Rewards, FPS Boost, and Auto Rejoin.\n- **All-in-One Kaitun** — Fully automated mining and progression.\n\n### ⚒️ Loot To Forge\n- **Max Gear** — Automatically optimize weapons, armor, hats, runes, and enhancements.\n- **Unlimited Auto Forge** — Forge using selected ores continuously.\n- **Auto Complete Index** — Find missing equipment and display forge probabilities.\n- **Item Spawner** — Spawn ores, enchant runes, weapons, armor, hats, and other resources.\n- **Inventory Duplication** — Duplicate inventory stacks with one click.\n- **Currency & Resources** — Add Season Coins, Race Rolls, Season Tickets, and Tokens.\n- **Auto Token Shop** — Obtain available passes and packs without spending tokens.\n- **Unlimited Potions** — Power and Damage potions with long-lasting buffs.\n- **Combat Tools** — Kill Aura, Auto Ore Boss, Invincibility, and Keep Ore on Death.\n- **Auto Tower Farm** — Farm rare stones and Season Coins using a single ticket.\n- **Auto Season** — Daily tickets, spins, season pass rewards, and shop automation.\n- **Auto Race Roll** — Roll for selected races and automatically refill rolls.\n- **Auto World Boss** — Join boss fights, defeat bosses, and claim reward cards.\n- **Smart Boss Server Hop** — Find active bosses, wait for spawns, and collect rewards.\n- **Pet Automation** — Auto incubate, hatch, refill slots, target rare pets, and manage surplus eggs.\n- **Auto Progression** — Sell, equip, train, click, rebirth, upgrade, and optimize race slots.\n- **Extra** — Item Previews, Low-Population Server Hop, Save/Return Position.\n- **All-in-One Kaitun** — Fully automated farming and progression.\n\n### 🌊 Open Sea For Animals\n- **Auto Loot** — Collect valuable eggs and Brainrots from incoming waves without leaving your base.\n- **Unlimited Carry** — Collect an entire wave at once. *(Risky)*\n- **Smart Loot Filters** — Customize collection by rarity and mutation.\n- **Auto Sell** — Automatically sell eggs and Brainrots with protected-item filters.\n- **Auto Hatch & Place** — Hatch eggs and place the best animals.\n- **Auto Progression** — Upgrades, training, best dumbbell, and rebirth.\n- **Auto Extras** — Pickaxe, potions, wheel spins, season rewards, and even","tags":["Mario Hub","Script Hub","Loot To Forge","Sniper Arena","Build the Pyramid"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/FHVfmeSceA","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6aba75064021d874655be644","username":"xDTaraZ","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/16ad89845a4e664dd3ca4acce5687ce0352b435ea07f0514b7df64855a0844a1.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6aba75064021d874655be644-1792437546946.png"},"lvl":4,"status":"offline","id":"6aba75064021d874655be644","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/16ad89845a4e664dd3ca4acce5687ce0352b435ea07f0514b7df6